{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45044","headline":"早春书怀寄李少府仲宣 · 皎然","name":"早春书怀寄李少府仲宣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早年初问法，因悟目中花。\n忽值胡雏起，芟夷如乱麻。\n脱身投彼岸，吊影念生涯。\n迹与空门合，心将世路赊。\n东田已芜没，南涧益伤嗟。\n崇替惊人事，凋残感物华。\n知君过我里，惆怅旧烟霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45044.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45044","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}